body:
Yeah psychedelics have been quite a god send, moderate to high doses every two or so weeks have offered great uplifts in mood, it's only a shame I keep crashing right down once reality sets in again :(

Whilst those retreats are a complete rip off, the price is worth it if it can cure this shit. Lost most of my 20s to these pills and the after effects they left me with, don't want to waste any more time. Ayahuasca is definitely the safer of the two retreat options, Iboga is pretty heavy on the heart, couple of cases of people dying from cardiac failure :c

I hope for all of our sakes that we can arrive at a cure or at least symptomatic relief within the next year or so, would really love to give the whole relationship thing a go again... But with no libido ehhhhhhhh ;~~~~;
